    "created_at": "2016-11-08T01:54:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-08T01:54:42Z",
    "body": "I think this claim is perhaps true for new properties added on existing objects, and especially on Array.prototype and Object.prototype, because those two would break a lot of for-in loops.\n\nI think adding enumerable stuff elsewhere would not have broken the web, and adding it on entirely new things is _very_ unlikely to do so.\n",
